# Baked Hyperscape captures live here (not in git)
#
# This directory is intentionally empty in the repository. Personal scan data
# is never committed — bake your own captures locally with:
#
#   python3 SplatSample/tools/hyperscape_to_quest.py <capture_id> \
#       --bundle-dir <your-hyperscape-bundle> \
#       --out-dir SplatSample/app/src/main/assets/captures \
#       --name "My Capture"
#
# See SplatSample/HYPERSCAPE.md for the full workflow. Without any captures
# the app falls back to its built-in Menlo Park / Los Angeles demo splats.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
